; fit comb: frame-notch widths (top) + MDF-channel widths (bottom)
; generated by emitter.py
; top strip: notch widths 2.9 3.0 3.1 3.2 3.3 3.4 3.5 (12mm deep), chamfer = narrow end
; bottom strip: MDF channel widths 3.0 3.1 3.2 3.3 3.4 3.5 3.6 (15mm deep), chamfer = narrow end
; toolpath widths: the kerf (~0.15mm) adds to every one
;
;HEAD: laser
;MATERIAL: plywood_veneer_3ply_3mm
;LASER_MODE: static  (M3 — dwell-burn-through risk if motion stalls)

$32=1   ; GRBL laser mode
G21     ; mm
G90     ; absolute
M5      ; laser off
G0 X0 Y0

